867
01:14:47,221 --> 01:14:48,789
Aku merasa lega.

868
01:14:50,458 --> 01:14:51,959
Jadi, aku...

869
01:14:52,059 --> 01:14:53,694
Aku ambil uangnya.

870
01:14:53,794 --> 01:14:55,396
Aku diam,

871
